COPY public.interview_questions (id, session_id, question_number, topic, difficulty, question_type, question, expected_skills) FROM stdin;
1	33093f1f-2ddd-4105-a200-6f040addd3bd	1	Python	Easy	Conceptual	What are Python decorators?	["Python", "Decorators"]
2	33093f1f-2ddd-4105-a200-6f040addd3bd	2	FastAPI	Medium	Conceptual	What is dependency injection in FastAPI?	["FastAPI", "Dependency Injection"]
3	33093f1f-2ddd-4105-a200-6f040addd3bd	3	SQL	Medium	Scenario	How would you optimize a slow SQL query?	["SQL", "Database Optimization"]
4	8af1659d-38b6-44a9-9fa4-0a3354ae6648	1	Python Fundamentals and OOP	Easy	Conceptual	What is the difference between a class and an object in Python, and how does encapsulation help in organizing your backend code?	["Object-Oriented Programming"]
5	8af1659d-38b6-44a9-9fa4-0a3354ae6648	2	Python Fundamentals and OOP	Medium	Coding	Write a Python class for a 'MedicalReport' that uses a private attribute for sensitive patient data and a public method to return a masked version of that data.	["Object-Oriented Programming", "Python"]
6	8af1659d-38b6-44a9-9fa4-0a3354ae6648	3	Flask REST API Architecture	Medium	Scenario	You are building a Flask REST API. How would you structure your project to separate business logic from route handlers, and why is this separation important?	["Flask", "REST APIs"]
7	8af1659d-38b6-44a9-9fa4-0a3354ae6648	4	Flask REST API Architecture	Hard	Follow-up	In your 'Medical Data Extraction' project, how do you handle large file uploads in Flask? What specific HTTP status code would you return if the uploaded file format is unsupported?	["Flask", "HTTP Status Codes"]
8	8af1659d-38b6-44a9-9fa4-0a3354ae6648	5	OCR Workflow and Image Processing	Medium	Scenario	When extracting data from medical forms using PaddleOCR or EasyOCR, the system occasionally fails due to poor image quality. What image preprocessing steps using OpenCV would you implement to improve accuracy?	["OpenCV", "PaddleOCR", "EasyOCR"]
9	8af1659d-38b6-44a9-9fa4-0a3354ae6648	6	Database Management and SQL Queries	Medium	Coding	Given a table 'Patients' and a table 'Reports', write a SQL query to find the names of patients who have more than 3 reports associated with them.	["MySQL", "SQL Queries"]
10	8af1659d-38b6-44a9-9fa4-0a3354ae6648	7	Database Management and SQL Queries	Medium	Conceptual	Explain the concept of database normalization. Why should you normalize a table in a Blood Bank Management System?	["MySQL", "Database Design"]
11	8af1659d-38b6-44a9-9fa4-0a3354ae6648	8	API Integration and Error Handling	Medium	Scenario	In your 'Web Language Translator' project, you integrate a third-party speech recognition API. How do you handle cases where the API returns a 500 error or a timeout to ensure your Flask app remains stable?	["API Integration", "Flask", "Error Handling"]
12	8af1659d-38b6-44a9-9fa4-0a3354ae6648	9	Git Workflow	Easy	Conceptual	If you are working on a new feature in your project and realize you have introduced a bug, how do you use Git to revert your local changes or switch to a stable branch?	["Git", "GitHub"]
13	8af1659d-38b6-44a9-9fa4-0a3354ae6648	10	API Integration and Error Handling	Hard	Conceptual	Define the concept of Idempotency in REST APIs. Why is it important to ensure your POST and PUT endpoints handle idempotency correctly in a healthcare application?	["REST APIs", "Idempotency"]
14	4c4d698b-85c6-4341-89b9-045f653f5909	1	Python Backend Development	Easy	Conceptual	What is a Python decorator, and how would you use one to implement a simple authentication check in a Flask route?	["Python", "Flask", "OOP"]
15	4c4d698b-85c6-4341-89b9-045f653f5909	2	RESTful API Design Principles	Medium	Scenario	You are designing a REST API for a Blood Bank Management System. How would you structure the endpoints to handle blood stock updates, and which HTTP methods would you use for updating inventory levels?	["REST APIs", "Database Design"]
16	4c4d698b-85c6-4341-89b9-045f653f5909	3	RESTful API Design Principles	Medium	Conceptual	Explain the concept of idempotency in REST APIs. Which HTTP methods are idempotent, and why is POST typically not considered idempotent?	["REST APIs", "HTTP Methods"]
17	4c4d698b-85c6-4341-89b9-045f653f5909	4	Database Normalization and Query Optimization	Medium	Coding	Given an Employees table, write a SQL query to find all employees whose name starts with 'A' and order the results by Salary in descending order, limiting to the top 5.	["MySQL", "SQL Queries"]
18	4c4d698b-85c6-4341-89b9-045f653f5909	5	Image Processing and OCR integration	Hard	Scenario	In your Healthcare Data Extraction project, you used OpenCV and OCR. If the OCR engine is returning low accuracy for medical forms, what image preprocessing steps would you implement before passing the image to PaddleOCR?	["OpenCV", "OCR", "Image Processing"]
19	4c4d698b-85c6-4341-89b9-045f653f5909	6	Web Framework Architecture (Flask)	Medium	Conceptual	How does Flask handle request routing internally, and what is the difference between using '@app.route' and creating a blueprint for larger applications?	["Flask", "Backend Development"]
20	4c4d698b-85c6-4341-89b9-045f653f5909	7	Object-Oriented Programming (OOP) concepts	Easy	Conceptual	Explain the difference between class attributes and instance attributes in Python. Provide a real-world example of when you would use each.	["OOP", "Python"]
21	4c4d698b-85c6-4341-89b9-045f653f5909	8	Version Control Best Practices (Git)	Easy	Scenario	You are working on a feature branch and realize you need the latest changes from the 'main' branch. Would you use 'git merge' or 'git rebase'? Explain your choice.	["Git", "Collaboration"]
22	4c4d698b-85c6-4341-89b9-045f653f5909	9	Data Handling and Automation (OpenPyXL)	Medium	Coding	Write a snippet using OpenPyXL to load an existing Excel file, append a new row of data to the active sheet, and save the file.	["Python", "OpenPyXL"]
23	4c4d698b-85c6-4341-89b9-045f653f5909	10	RESTful API Design Principles	Hard	Follow-up	When building a bulk-delete endpoint for your management system, why is it better to use a POST request with a JSON body containing IDs rather than multiple individual DELETE requests?	["REST APIs", "System Design"]
24	729154f7-5b56-4606-81ae-6b536fa75c18	1	Flask Framework Architecture	Medium	Conceptual	In your 'AI healthcare solutions' project, you used Flask. Explain the difference between request handling in a development server versus a production-grade WSGI server like Gunicorn. Why is this distinction important for image processing tasks?	["Flask", "Backend Development", "Production Deployment"]
25	729154f7-5b56-4606-81ae-6b536fa75c18	2	Image Processing Pipelines	Medium	Scenario	When using OpenCV to preprocess medical images for OCR (PaddleOCR/EasyOCR), what specific image transformations would you apply to improve extraction accuracy if the input images have inconsistent lighting or noise?	["OpenCV", "Image Processing", "OCR"]
26	729154f7-5b56-4606-81ae-6b536fa75c18	3	REST API Design	Easy	Conceptual	Your project uses a REST API to extract data. If you were to add an endpoint to retrieve the status of a specific long-running document extraction job, which HTTP method would you use, and what status code should be returned if the job is still 'In Progress'?	["REST APIs", "HTTP Methods", "Status Codes"]
27	729154f7-5b56-4606-81ae-6b536fa75c18	4	Python OOP	Medium	Coding	Design a base class 'DocumentExtractor' using Abstract Base Classes (ABC) in Python. How would you ensure that any subclass (e.g., 'MedicalFormExtractor', 'InvoiceExtractor') must implement an 'extract_fields' method?	["Object-Oriented Programming", "Python", "Design Patterns"]
28	729154f7-5b56-4606-81ae-6b536fa75c18	5	Database Schema Design	Medium	Scenario	For a Blood Bank Management System, how would you design the relationship between 'Donors' and 'BloodInventory' in MySQL to ensure that updates to inventory are atomic and consistent?	["MySQL", "Database Schema Design", "ACID Properties"]
29	729154f7-5b56-4606-81ae-6b536fa75c18	6	Data Handling	Easy	Coding	You mentioned using OpenPyXL to generate reports. Write a brief Python snippet demonstrating how to load an existing Excel workbook, add a new row of data to the first sheet, and save the file.	["OpenPyXL", "Python", "Data Manipulation"]
30	729154f7-5b56-4606-81ae-6b536fa75c18	7	Exception Handling and Security	Medium	Scenario	In a Flask API that processes user-uploaded medical images, what security measures would you implement to prevent malicious files (e.g., script injections or extremely large files) from being processed?	["Security", "Flask", "Exception Handling"]
31	729154f7-5b56-4606-81ae-6b536fa75c18	8	Idempotency	Medium	Conceptual	Why is the POST method considered non-idempotent, and how would you implement a mechanism in a Flask API to handle duplicate requests (e.g., if a user double-clicks a submit button)?	["REST APIs", "Idempotency", "Backend logic"]
32	729154f7-5b56-4606-81ae-6b536fa75c18	9	Follow-up on OCR	Hard	Follow-up	Following up on your OCR project: If the OCR pipeline frequently fails due to OCR engine latency, what architectural strategy would you use to prevent the Flask thread from blocking, while still providing the user with a response?	["Asynchronous Processing", "Flask", "System Design"]
33	729154f7-5b56-4606-81ae-6b536fa75c18	10	SQL Queries	Easy	Coding	Write a SQL query to select all donors from a 'Donors' table whose blood group is 'O+' and who have donated in the last 6 months.	["SQL", "MySQL", "Date Filtering"]
