299	2285da9e-4a43-4a80-bf38-8541b53bd694	8	Database Management (MySQL)	Entry	Scenario	Considering your Blood Bank Management System, how would you design the database schema to handle real-time inventory updates efficiently while maintaining consistency across concurrent donor registration and search requests?	["MySQL", "Database Schema Design"]
300	2285da9e-4a43-4a80-bf38-8541b53bd694	9	Machine Learning Pipelines	Junior	Conceptual	What is the primary role of domain knowledge in clustering algorithms (e.g., k-means), and at what point does its effectiveness diminish as the number of clusters increases?	["Unsupervised Learning", "Data Analysis"]
301	2285da9e-4a43-4a80-bf38-8541b53bd694	10	Machine Learning Pipelines	Entry	Conceptual	Explain the concept of 'PAC learning' (Probably Approximately Correct) and its significance when determining the sample complexity for training an AI model on medical document data.	["Machine Learning Theory"]
302	06f4a381-fc7c-4f29-b0c5-c4fd6c686343	1	REST API Design	Entry	Scenario	You are building a REST API to serve an OCR model. Given that image processing can be computationally expensive, how would you design your endpoints to handle high-volume document requests without blocking the client?	["Flask", "REST APIs", "System Design"]
303	06f4a381-fc7c-4f29-b0c5-c4fd6c686343	2	OCR implementation	Entry	Conceptual	In your Healthcare project, you used ROI-based preprocessing. How does the quality of image preprocessing directly impact the performance of PaddleOCR, and what specific steps would you take if the text extraction precision is low due to image noise?	["OpenCV", "PaddleOCR", "Image Preprocessing"]
304	06f4a381-fc7c-4f29-b0c5-c4fd6c686343	3	Machine Learning Fundamentals	Entry	Conceptual	Based on the concept of Task T, Performance measure P, and Training experience E, how would you formally define the 'AI Healthcare Solution' project you developed?	["Machine Learning Fundamentals"]
305	06f4a381-fc7c-4f29-b0c5-c4fd6c686343	4	Evaluation Metrics	Entry	Conceptual	If you were building a document retrieval system, you would use Mean Average Precision (MAP). Explain the difference between Precision at rank k and Average Precision (AveP) in the context of ranking relevant documents.	["Information Retrieval", "Machine Learning Metrics"]
306	06f4a381-fc7c-4f29-b0c5-c4fd6c686343	5	Supervised Learning	Entry	Conceptual	What is the primary advantage of using Gaussian Processes over other supervised learning methods like kernel regression, specifically regarding the model's confidence in its predictions?	["Gaussian Processes", "Supervised Learning"]
307	06f4a381-fc7c-4f29-b0c5-c4fd6c686343	6	Topic Modeling	Entry	Conceptual	You have a large collection of medical documents. Explain how Latent Dirichlet Allocation (LDA) can be used to automatically discover topics within these documents.	["Topic Modeling", "NLP"]
308	06f4a381-fc7c-4f29-b0c5-c4fd6c686343	7	Learning Theory	Entry	Scenario	Imagine your model is underperforming. According to learning theory, what is the role of an 'external oracle' or teacher in a query-based learning scenario, and how could this help improve your model's accuracy?	["Machine Learning Theory", "Supervised Learning"]
309	06f4a381-fc7c-4f29-b0c5-c4fd6c686343	8	Domain Knowledge & Heuristics	Entry	Conceptual	When building models for clustering or classification, why might 'domain knowledge' be highly effective for a small number of groups but lose its utility as the complexity or number of clusters increases?	["Clustering", "Domain Expertise"]
310	06f4a381-fc7c-4f29-b0c5-c4fd6c686343	9	Database Schema Design	Entry	Coding	For your Blood Bank Management System, if you had to design a table to track blood inventory with real-time updates, how would you ensure data integrity using SQL constraints?	["MySQL", "Database Schema Design"]
311	06f4a381-fc7c-4f29-b0c5-c4fd6c686343	10	Decision Trees	Entry	Conceptual	A decision tree represents a disjunction of conjunctions. If you were visualizing the path from root to leaf in a diagnostic decision tree, what does each step along that path signify regarding the input attributes?	["Decision Trees", "ML Logic"]
312	0716c186-4786-4acf-9048-cc09e6acfdac	1	Python Programming	Entry-level	Coding	Given a list of strings, write a function to filter out common 'stop words' before feeding the text into an OCR pipeline. How would you handle variations in word forms (e.g., 'draw', 'drawn', 'draws') efficiently?	["Python", "NLP"]
313	0716c186-4786-4acf-9048-cc09e6acfdac	2	Backend API Design	Entry-level	Scenario	You are building a Flask API for a blood bank management system. If you need to search for donor records based on blood type and location, how would you design the database schema and query structure to optimize for performance?	["Flask", "MySQL", "Database Modeling"]
314	0716c186-4786-4acf-9048-cc09e6acfdac	3	Computer Vision & OCR	Entry-level	Conceptual	When building an OCR pipeline using OpenCV and EasyOCR for healthcare documents, why is image preprocessing (such as thresholding or noise reduction) critical before passing the image to the model?	["OpenCV", "OCR", "Computer Vision"]
315	0716c186-4786-4acf-9048-cc09e6acfdac	4	Machine Learning Lifecycle	Entry-level	Conceptual	In the context of the Machine Learning Specialization, explain the difference between Ridge regression and standard Linear Regression. How does the 'alpha' parameter influence the model's ability to generalize to new data?	["Machine Learning", "Regularization"]
316	0716c186-4786-4acf-9048-cc09e6acfdac	5	Machine Learning Lifecycle	Entry-level	Debugging	You notice your model has high training accuracy but low test accuracy (overfitting). Based on the concept of 'model complexity,' how would you adjust the hyperparameters of a DecisionTreeClassifier to fix this?	["Decision Trees", "Model Evaluation"]
317	0716c186-4786-4acf-9048-cc09e6acfdac	6	Machine Learning Lifecycle	Entry-level	Conceptual	Explain the role of Latent Dirichlet Allocation (LDA) in analyzing large text corpora. If you increase the number of topics from 10 to 100, what is the trade-off in terms of topic specialization and interpretation?	["Unsupervised Learning", "LDA", "Topic Modeling"]
318	0716c186-4786-4acf-9048-cc09e6acfdac	7	Vector Databases & Embeddings	Entry-level	Conceptual	Given your interest in vector databases, how would you explain the process of converting unstructured text into vectors (embeddings) to enable similarity searches in an AI application?	["Vector Databases", "Embeddings"]
319	0716c186-4786-4acf-9048-cc09e6acfdac	8	Machine Learning Lifecycle	Entry-level	Scenario	When performing a Grid Search (GridSearchCV) to tune model hyperparameters, why is it inefficient to search over all combinations if some parameters are conditional? How should you structure your search grid instead?	["Hyperparameter Tuning", "Scikit-learn"]
320	0716c186-4786-4acf-9048-cc09e6acfdac	9	Python Programming	Entry-level	Coding	Using the provided knowledge about pandas, write a code snippet to filter a DataFrame of medical records to select only those entries where the patient's age is greater than 30.	["Python", "Pandas", "Data Manipulation"]
321	0716c186-4786-4acf-9048-cc09e6acfdac	10	Machine Learning Lifecycle	Entry-level	Conceptual	Why is it important to ensure that the evaluation of a test set happens only once, after selecting the final model? What happens if you use the test set to repeatedly tune your parameters?	["Model Evaluation", "Best Practices"]
